# Anafenza, Unyielding Lineage: Bot1 declines the counters when its Savannah Lions dies, so Anafenza stays a 2/2 and a 2/2 white
# Spirit token is created (CR 701.63a). When that token dies on turn 5 Anafenza does not trigger: it is a token (CR 111.7), so the
# stack stays empty and Anafenza is not asked.

